  <page_number>456</page_number>
  <running_head>INSTITUTIONUM</running_head>
  <main_text>
    <l n="1">
      <i>quidem initium facit, at ante ejus plenam</i>
    </l>
    <l n="2">
      <i>elaborationem etiam ad aliarum partium</i>
    </l>
    <l n="3">
      <i>conflitutionem fe convertit.</i>
    </l>
    <l n="4" para="true">§. Atque ita mihi videor posse</l>
    <l n="5">sententiam Hippocratis &amp; Aristotelis con-</l>
    <l n="6">ciliare. Nam dum ille omnes partes</l>
    <l n="7">principes simul elaborari censet, acci-</l>
    <l n="8">pio, quod nullam prius plene confli-</l>
    <l n="9">ciat, antequam ad aliorum structuram</l>
    <l n="10">se converterit: absolute tamen a corde</l>
    <l n="11">initium facit, utpote a cujus influxu</l>
    <l n="12">cæteræ partes omnes dependent,&amp; quæ</l>
    <l n="13">primum omnium vivit &amp; omnium ul-</l>
    <l n="14">timo moritur. Conferatur Arist. l.1.de</l>
    <l n="15">gener. animal. c.4. Iltud vero quomod-</l>
    <l n="16">o singulæ partes hinc conformentur,</l>
    <l n="17">prolixum foret recensere.</l>
    <l n="18" para="true">VIII. <i>Cum jam partes aliquatenus</i>
    </l>
    <l n="19">
      <i>constitutæ sunt, sanguine per arterias</i>
    </l>
    <l n="20">
      <i>uteri illabente &amp; in venam umbilicalem</i>
    </l>
    <l n="21">
      <i>effusio fœtus alimoniam trahit, ea ratione</i>
    </l>
    <l n="22">
      <i>qua concoctionem secundam &amp; tertiam</i>
    </l>
    <l n="23">
      <i>in animalibus supra fieri infinuavimus.</i>
    </l>
    <l n="24" para="true">§. Hoc tamen discrimen est, quod</l>
    <l n="25">ex dextro cordis ventriculo in finistrum</l>
    <l n="26">cordis sinum per foramen ovale non</l>
    <l n="27">parum sanguinis transfeat: quia per pul-</l>
    <l n="28">mones ob respirationis omnimodam</l>
    <l n="29">carentiam aut exiguitatem distributio</l>
    <l n="30">non ita commoda esse potest. Itemque quod</l>
  </main_text>
  <notes />
</page>
